<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.wiki.switches ~ switch the live wiki

`slug` names the wiki the worn face switches to, live.

The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list. The MCP seat runs this act in its own process: the vessel's `call` binds the params against this carrier's live `#/takes` and answers `handler/seat` with the bound params, and the seat runs them (`act(address="lar:///engine.wiki.switches", args={…})`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/word needs/required ~ the wiki by slug`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel verbs the seat's handler reaches check the face's cap and the asker's hand themselves; a hand act refuses a seat by its own code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! act lar:///engine.wiki.switches

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`handler/seat spells/[[act lar:///engine.wiki.switches]] ~ the seat runs it in its own process`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

